Package: colorRanges
Title: Create and Evaluate Color Ranges for Nested Categories
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Eli", "Spies", , "treibsand@posteo.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-4071-4476"))
Description: This package provides lightweight tools based on the
    colorspace package for generating related color ranges, assigning
    colors to subcategories nested within broader categories, and
    visualizing palettes under simulated color vision deficiencies. The
    package is intended to simplify consistent color assignment for
    hierar- chical categorical datain scientific visualizations.
